glint (1.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Replace the multi-colour glass icon with an orange crop-frame G, with
    matching small-size and symbolic variants.
  * Use warm orange for selection outlines, guides, handles, confirmation
    buttons, text editing bounds and focused pin borders.
  * Add the author's email to preferences, with mail and copy actions, and
